OL,3,GNEWSACanal users warned after poisonous
OL,4,Aplant spotted
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors to a canal towpath have been
OL,7,Fwarned to avoid a poisonous plant after
OL,8,Fit was spotted along the route.
OL,10,FParish councillor Richard Lucas said
OL,11,Fhemlock water dropwort had been seen
OL,12,Falong the Basingstoke Canal in Ash
OL,13,FVale, Surrey.
OL,15,FThe native plant is "extremely
OL,16,Fpoisonous" and should only be touched
OL,17,Fwearing gloves, according to the Royal
OL,18,FHorticultural Society.
OL,20,FLucas said the plant was "quite
OL,21,Fwidespread" in the area and "extremely
OL,22,Fdangerous".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
